{
  "name": "get_grant",
  "description": "Read one approval request or grant (ADR-249): phase, the exact reviewed plan (target, actions, filters, data class and reasons), requester, decision with the approver's authentication context, expiry, revocation and the remaining result-access pool. Visible to its requester and to current approvers of the workload; anyone else is told it is not available.",
